# Ecosystem reuse

`giga_mario_bench` depends on [Giga_Mario](https://github.com/Sirius-Back/Giga_Mario). The two checkouts are one ecosystem.

- Call an existing Giga_Mario function instead of copying it. Train/test/val assignment goes through `src.pipeline.split_predict.run_split_predict`.
- A change may land in either repository, in the one that already owns that behavior.
- New genomic model adapters belong in Giga_Mario when `parse_data` or its train wrappers already cover that role. This bench keeps only adapters Giga_Mario does not provide, and it still asks Giga_Mario for the split.
- Prefer a previously debugged function over a new one.

Read `CONTRIBUTING.md` before adding a feature or editing an existing one. Read the Giga_Mario wiki before changing a shared contract.
